#title  Every Last One (Eren's vow)
#song   0x28
#tempo  72
#reverb 50
; D minor. Builds from a string tremolo and a lone piano to the full main theme:
; piano alone (4 bars), cellos and choir take theme A (4), brass sings theme B
; over driving strings (8), and the whole orchestra states theme A (4), ending
; on the dominant so the loop falls back into the quiet opening. 20 bars.

